the points made in the statement deliv-
ered by Ambassador Jos6 Ayala Lasso
on agenda item 108, in the Third Com-
mittee on 14 November 1989, particu-
larly as concerns the interpretation to be
given to article 24, in the light of the pre-
amble of the Convention, and article 38.
