program will retain their legal status as citizens of the U.S.
Gaverrvient. FAA eaployees and their supervision and
aedinistration shall be in accordance with policies and procedures
of the FAM. However, said emrployees shall oberve the standards
of discipline and trustworthiness which are mandatory for
officials in public service.
